SDL-E1039 (spec/access.md)

  x invalid access verification source: a `url:` source takes no local key — remove `algorithm:` (and `key:`)
   ,----
 1 | access sso { on: root; type: jwt; url: 'https://x/jwks'; algorithm: hs256; };
   :                                                                   ^^^^|^^^^
   :                                                                       `-- the verification source is malformed
   `----
  help: the verification source is exactly one of `url: <expr>;` (a JWKS endpoint) or `algorithm: <word>;` + `key: <expr>;` (a local key)
